{"seq":2,"slug":"options-pricing","title":"期权定价","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/derivatives-pricing/options-pricing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"european-american-options","title":"欧式与美式期权定价","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/derivatives-pricing/options-pricing/european-american-options","wordCount":2101,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"exotic-options","title":"奇异期权定价方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/derivatives-pricing/options-pricing/exotic-options","wordCount":2041,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"volatility-surface","title":"波动率曲面与微笑","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/derivatives-pricing/options-pricing/volatility-surface","wordCount":2195,"readingTime":9}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"期权定价\">期权定价</h1><p>本章聚焦各类期权产品的定价方法与实践。从经典的欧式与美式期权出发，讨论提前行权特征对定价的影响与数值处理方式；进而覆盖障碍期权、亚式期权、回望期权等奇异期权的定价技术；最后深入波动率曲面的构建与校准，解析隐含波动率微笑/偏斜的成因与建模方法。三篇文档从标准到复杂、从模型到市场，完整覆盖期权定价的核心议题。</p>\n"}